OL,3,GNEWSACleft lip filler 'boosts
OL,4,Aconfidence' - but expert warns of
OL,5,Aexploitation risk
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo young women who have turned to
OL,8,Fdermal fillers after having cleft lip
OL,9,Fsurgery say it has given them
OL,10,Fconfidence after they were both left
OL,11,Fwith scarring.
OL,13,F"Now I feel like I can just go out and
OL,14,Ftalk to anyone, be more social and just
OL,15,Fbe confident," Amber Dorgan, 20, from
OL,16,FNeath, said of the treatment, which is
OL,17,Foffered by the NHS as well as by
OL,18,Faesthetic clinics.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
