OL,3,GNEWSACleft lip filler 'boosts
OL,4,Aconfidence' - but expert warns of
OL,5,Aexploitation risk
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut experts and clinics have called for
OL,8,Fregulations to be introduced for
OL,9,Faesthetic practitioners providing the
OL,10,Fservice.
OL,12,FIt comes as one psychology academic
OL,13,Fwarned people with a cleft lip were
OL,14,Fbeing "deliberately targeted" by the
OL,15,Faesthetics industry and "left
OL,16,Fvulnerable to potential harm and
OL,17,Fexploitation".
